Z||000005||Pontiaddict||08-13-2000||03:32 PM||||I was thinking about a Fiero Speedster. Start  with a notchback (less overhanging weight.)<BR>Topless with the windsheild lowered like Archie's chop top.<BR>Besides the windsheild, there would be no glass,(weight savings)  and no AC (wouldn't need it).<BR>3.4 tdc  or supercharged twin cam four for the power to weight ratio.<BR>5 speed (for fun). That ought to move!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I'd want a rollbar in it though.<P>The GT the guy has looks good too. I would have used the 87-88 nose though, it's missing a turn signal too.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Pontiaddict (edited 08-13-2000).]||||reg||1
